<title>USA: BP's Alaska budget expected to be increased.</title>
<headline>BP's Alaska budget expected to be increased.</headline>
<dateline>ANCHORAGE 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>BP America Inc, a leading producer of Alaskan crude oil, is planning a substantial increase in its exploration and production budget for the state.</p>
<p>According to a state official, the Alaskan governor and executives of the BP Exploration Alaska Inc will announce an increase in capital spending in Anchorage, the state capital, late Monday morning.</p>
</text>
